{"id":"78a1a0c916e243a2","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-projection-function.md","title":"Projection Function","display":"df-projection-function — Projection Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-projection-function","aliases":["88-df-projection-function"],"display":"df-projection-function — Projection Function","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-projection-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-projection-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection-function — Projection Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq i\\leq n\">\\(1\\leq i\\leq n\\)</span> (projection index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(P_i^n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (projection function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to\n\\bigl[P_i^n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\nP_i^n(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)=x_i\\bigr])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to\n\\bigl[P_i^n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\nP_i^n(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)=x_i\\bigr])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>和坐标<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>都在断言内量化，投影族因而不是依赖标题中隐含参数的\n单个函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq i\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"P_i^n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall i\\;(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to\n\\bigl[P_i^n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\forall(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\;\nP_i^n(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)=x_i\\bigr])","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":767,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce76a1073595f5b0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"245643a3d9f97585","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P$ : 投影函数 (see [[88-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.m